@startuml
title Use Case: My Applications View
actor User
participant MyApplications.vue
participant applications.ts
participant applications.py
participant application_service.py
database MySQL

User -> MyApplications.vue: Visit /my-applications
MyApplications.vue -> applications.ts: listApplications(mode=applicant)
applications.ts -> applications.py: GET /applications?mode=applicant
applications.py -> application_service.py: list_applications()
application_service.py -> MySQL: SELECT applications WHERE applicant_id
MySQL --> application_service.py: applications[]
application_service.py --> applications.py: result
applications.py --> applications.ts: 200 OK
applications.ts --> MyApplications.vue: applications
MyApplications.vue --> User: Display my applications

User -> MyApplications.vue: Withdraw application
MyApplications.vue -> applications.ts: withdrawApplication(id)
applications.ts -> applications.py: DELETE /applications/{id}
applications.py -> application_service.py: withdraw_application()
application_service.py -> MySQL: UPDATE applications SET status=WITHDRAWN
MySQL --> application_service.py: success
application_service.py --> applications.py: success
applications.py --> applications.ts: 200 OK
applications.ts --> MyApplications.vue: success
MyApplications.vue --> User: Withdrawn successfully
@enduml